{"articleNo":"2268","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2268&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"한국장학재단 2009 이공계대학원연구장학생 신청안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.06.30","hit":"23901","attachments":[{"name":"신청분야(대학원-유형I).xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2268&attachNo=1470"},{"name":"지도교수추천서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2268&attachNo=1605"},{"name":"2009 연구장학생 사업시행계획_유형I.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2268&attachNo=1677"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;한국장학재단에서 시행하는 2009년도 이공계대학원 연구장학생 사업을&nbsp; 아래와 같이</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 알려드리오니 관심있는 학생들의 많은 참여바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">-&nbsp; 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래&nbsp; -</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"52\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"38\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">구분</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"596\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"38\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">신청유형Ⅰ</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">(석사 및 박사과정생의 연구지원) </span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"52\" bgcolor=\"#ccff99\" height=\"69\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">대상</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"596\" height=\"69\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;￭ 대한민국 국적 보유자로 국내 대학원의 <u><strong>자연계열 및 공학계열 학과</strong></u>&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;2009년도 전일제(full-time) 석사 및 박사과정생</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;○ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2009-2학기 기준</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 석사과정은 2학기차 및 3학기차 재학생&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 박사과정은 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2009-2학기 기준</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 2학기차 이상부터 수료생까지</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"52\" bgcolor=\"#ccff99\" height=\"210\" rowspan=\"2\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">신청</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">제한</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"596\" height=\"105\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;￭ 참여제한<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; ① 취업자&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ② 석․박사과정 Part-time제 재학생<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp; ③ 2009-2학기 현재 석․박사과정 휴학생 및 신입생<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp; ④ 석사과정 4학기차 이상부터 수료 및 졸업(예정)자<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp; ⑤ 박사과정 2010. 2월 기준 졸업자<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp; ⑥ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">기존 장학생은 선정당시 학위과정에서는 신청불가<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp; ⑦ 외국인학생</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"596\" height=\"105\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;￭ 장학금 중복수혜자 참여제한</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;① 적용기간 : 2009년 9월 ~ 2010년 8월까지(1년)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;② 적용대상<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: -1.6pt\">-&nbsp; 교육부 BK사업 및 누리사업에 참여하여 지급받은 인건비(장학금)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 정부 또는 민간장학재단으로부터 지급받은 장학금<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;③ 적용제외<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: -1.6pt\">- 연구(조)원 수당, 연구 및 교육조교(RA 및 TA) 수당, 근로장학생 수당 등</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"52\" bgcolor=\"#ccff99\" height=\"120\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">신청</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">기준</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"596\" height=\"120\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;￭ 지도교수 추천</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;￭ 학위과정 全학기 성적 및 연구계획서 제출 </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;○ 학업성적<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 석사 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">학사 학위 全학년 졸업성적 평균B+이상(평점</span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">3.5</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">이상)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 박사 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">석사 학위 全학년 졸업성적 평균B+이상(평점</span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">3.5</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">이상)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;○&nbsp;연구계획서는 신청학생 본인이 연구책임자로서&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;연구결과보고서를 제출가능하여야 함(독창성 우선)<br></span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (단, 이전학위 과정 논문 또는 기존 선행 연구의 요약이나 편집 등은 불가)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"52\" bgcolor=\"#ccff99\" height=\"32\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">지원</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">규모</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"596\" height=\"32\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;￭ 석사 선발인원 : 150명 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">1인당 800만원<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;￭ 박사 선발인원 : 250명 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">1인당 1,200만원</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"52\" bgcolor=\"#ccff99\" height=\"46\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">신청</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">기한</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"596\" height=\"46\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;￭ 온라인신청&nbsp;:</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">2009.7.1(수) ~ 7. 30(목) 18시까지<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;￭ 서류제출기한 :&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">2009.7.1(수) ~ 7. 31(금) 18시까지</span><br>&nbsp;￭ 서류제출처 : 대학원지원팀(글로벌관412호)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"52\" bgcolor=\"#ccff99\" height=\"105\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">신청</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">방법</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"596\" height=\"105\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;1단계)온라인&nbsp;개별신청:&nbsp;한국장학재단&nbsp;</span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">(</span><a href=\"http://scholarship.kosaf.go.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">http://scholarship.kosaf.go.kr</span></a><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;2단계) 대학원지원팀으로 신청서 및 증빙서류 각 5부 제출</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;① 온라신청서 5부(온라인 신청완료 후 출력가능)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;② 지도교수추천서 5부(사본)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;③ 성적증명서 5부(신청자 現&nbsp;학위과정 성적표)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;④ 연구계획서 5부</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;3단계) 대학원지원팀에서 한국장학재단으로 일괄 송부</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"648\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"51\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">※ 자세한&nbsp;사항은&nbsp;한국장학재단&nbsp;홈페이지&nbsp;공지사항 참조</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">☎ 문의처 : 한국장학재단 장학사업부(02-2259-2111)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">[첨부파일 다운로드]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;1. 2009년도 이공계 대학원 연구장학생 사업 안내&nbsp;1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;2. 2009년도 이공계 대학원 연구장학생 지도교수추천서(양식) 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;3. 신청분야 목록 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">금오공과대학교 대학원장</span></p>\n<!--StartFragment-->\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
